      "y": 390,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "FILE: backend/app/tools/products.py\nCalls: client = ShopifyGraphQLClient()\nCalls: client.execute(query, variables)\n\nTools Exported:\n• shopify_search_products(query, limit)\n• shopify_get_product_details(product_id)\n• shopify_create_product(title, price...)\n• shopify_update_product(product_id...)\n• shopify_set_product_metafield(id, key...)\n\nHelper: _normalize_gid(raw_id, type)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1
    },
